{"id": 267, "date": "2026-10-01T15:41:58", "date_gmt": "2026-10-01T15:41:58", "guid": {"rendered": "https://medluxlife.de/health/clinical-treatments/iv-treatments/", "raw": "https://medluxlife.de/health/clinical-treatments/iv-treatments/"}, "modified": "2026-10-07T18:20:40", "modified_gmt": "2026-10-07T18:20:40", "password": "", "slug": "iv-treatments", "status": "publish", "type": "page", "link": "https://medluxlife.de/health/clinical-treatments/iv-treatments/", "title": {"raw": "IV Treatments", "rendered": "IV Treatments"}, "content": {"raw": "<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-lead\">IV treatments deliver vitamins, minerals and other nutrients directly into the bloodstream, so they are fully available to the body. They are designed to support energy, regeneration and overall well-being, and every infusion is selected after a short medical assessment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":336,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-intro-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-treatments-1021x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Woman relaxing during an IV infusion\" class=\"wp-image-336\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Our IV treatments</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":337,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-myers-cocktail-839x1024.jpg\" alt=\"IV bags with vitamin-rich fruits\" class=\"wp-image-337\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Myers' Cocktail</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A classic infusion with vitamin C, B vitamins, magnesium and calcium to support energy, immunity and general well-being.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":338,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-nad-751x1024.jpg\" alt=\"IV infusion bag\" class=\"wp-image-338\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">NAD+</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide is a coenzyme involved in cellular energy production. The infusion is used to support energy, mental clarity and healthy ageing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":339,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-hair-nail-927x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Woman with healthy, shiny hair\" class=\"wp-image-339\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hair and Nail Cocktail</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Supports stronger hair and nails and healthy hair growth, and nourishes the follicles, for example after a hair transplant.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":340,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-beauty-cocktail-1024x968.jpg\" alt=\"Woman relaxing in a robe during treatment\" class=\"wp-image-340\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Beauty Cocktail</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Supports skin firmness, smoothness and moisture, promotes collagen production and complements facial mesotherapy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":341,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-fat-burning-1024x701.jpg\" alt=\"Slim waist, weight management theme\" class=\"wp-image-341\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Fat Burning Slim Boost</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With L-carnitine and other nutrients to support metabolism and fat burning as part of a weight-management programme.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":342,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-vitamin-c-642x1024.jpg\" alt=\"IV drip with fresh oranges\" class=\"wp-image-342\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Vitamin C Megadose</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>High-dose vitamin C with antioxidant properties that supports the immune system, tissue regeneration and collagen production.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":343,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-alpha-lipoic-acid-809x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Hands resting on the knee\" class=\"wp-image-343\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Alpha Lipoic Acid</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A strong antioxidant that helps to regenerate other antioxidants such as vitamins C and E and supports nerve health and metabolism.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":344,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-immune-plus-808x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Hands forming a heart on the stomach\" class=\"wp-image-344\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Immune Plus</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Supports immune function, energy metabolism and antioxidant capacity.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":345,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-collagen-booster-685x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Smiling woman holding a green smoothie\" class=\"wp-image-345\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Anti-ageing Collagen Booster</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Amino acids, vitamins and minerals that support collagen production, skin health and overall vitality.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Glutathione</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A powerful antioxidant that supports the body's natural detoxification and the immune system and helps protect cells from oxidative stress.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How MedLuxLife supports you</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-steps\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Free consultation</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Share your wishes and, if available, recent X-rays or photos. We answer your questions and explain the options.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal treatment plan</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our partner specialists prepare a treatment plan and an estimated timeline tailored to you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Travel &amp; treatment</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We coordinate your appointments, hotel and airport transfers, so you can focus on your treatment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Aftercare</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We stay in touch after you return home and help with follow-up questions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-cta\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan your IV treatment with confidence</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every treatment begins with a personal, no-obligation consultation. Contact us and we will get back to you as soon as possible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-primary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://medluxlife.de/contact/\">Request a Free Consultation</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-whatsapp\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-disclaimer\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer\">The information on this page is for general guidance only and does not replace a medical consultation. Suitability for any treatment is assessed individually by a qualified doctor.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->", "rendered": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-e35d3e13 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"medlux-lead wp-block-paragraph\">IV treatments deliver vitamins, minerals and other nutrients directly into the bloodstream, so they are fully available to the body. They are designed to support energy, regeneration and overall well-being, and every infusion is selected after a short medical assessment.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-intro-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1021\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-treatments-1021x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Woman relaxing during an IV infusion\" class=\"wp-image-336\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-treatments-1021x1024.jpg 1021w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-treatments-300x300.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-treatments-150x150.jpg 150w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-treatments-768x770.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-treatments-1531x1536.jpg 1531w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-treatments-12x12.jpg 12w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-treatments.jpg 1594w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1021px) 100vw, 1021px\" /></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Our IV treatments</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"839\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-myers-cocktail-839x1024.jpg\" alt=\"IV bags with vitamin-rich fruits\" class=\"wp-image-337\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-myers-cocktail-839x1024.jpg 839w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-myers-cocktail-246x300.jpg 246w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-myers-cocktail-768x938.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-myers-cocktail-1258x1536.jpg 1258w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-myers-cocktail-10x12.jpg 10w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-myers-cocktail.jpg 1295w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 839px) 100vw, 839px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Myers&#8217; Cocktail</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A classic infusion with vitamin C, B vitamins, magnesium and calcium to support energy, immunity and general well-being.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"751\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-nad-751x1024.jpg\" alt=\"IV infusion bag\" class=\"wp-image-338\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-nad-751x1024.jpg 751w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-nad-220x300.jpg 220w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-nad-768x1048.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-nad-1126x1536.jpg 1126w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-nad-9x12.jpg 9w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-nad.jpg 1173w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 751px) 100vw, 751px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">NAD+</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide is a coenzyme involved in cellular energy production. The infusion is used to support energy, mental clarity and healthy ageing.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"927\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-hair-nail-927x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Woman with healthy, shiny hair\" class=\"wp-image-339\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-hair-nail-927x1024.jpg 927w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-hair-nail-271x300.jpg 271w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-hair-nail-768x849.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-hair-nail-11x12.jpg 11w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-hair-nail.jpg 1388w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 927px) 100vw, 927px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hair and Nail Cocktail</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Supports stronger hair and nails and healthy hair growth, and nourishes the follicles, for example after a hair transplant.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"968\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-beauty-cocktail-1024x968.jpg\" alt=\"Woman relaxing in a robe during treatment\" class=\"wp-image-340\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-beauty-cocktail-1024x968.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-beauty-cocktail-300x284.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-beauty-cocktail-768x726.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-beauty-cocktail-1536x1452.jpg 1536w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-beauty-cocktail-13x12.jpg 13w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-beauty-cocktail.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Beauty Cocktail</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Supports skin firmness, smoothness and moisture, promotes collagen production and complements facial mesotherapy.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"701\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-fat-burning-1024x701.jpg\" alt=\"Slim waist, weight management theme\" class=\"wp-image-341\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-fat-burning-1024x701.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-fat-burning-300x205.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-fat-burning-768x525.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-fat-burning-18x12.jpg 18w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-fat-burning.jpg 1295w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Fat Burning Slim Boost</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">With L-carnitine and other nutrients to support metabolism and fat burning as part of a weight-management programme.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"642\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-vitamin-c-642x1024.jpg\" alt=\"IV drip with fresh oranges\" class=\"wp-image-342\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-vitamin-c-642x1024.jpg 642w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-vitamin-c-188x300.jpg 188w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-vitamin-c-768x1225.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-vitamin-c-963x1536.jpg 963w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-vitamin-c-8x12.jpg 8w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-vitamin-c.jpg 1003w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 642px) 100vw, 642px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Vitamin C Megadose</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">High-dose vitamin C with antioxidant properties that supports the immune system, tissue regeneration and collagen production.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"809\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-alpha-lipoic-acid-809x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Hands resting on the knee\" class=\"wp-image-343\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-alpha-lipoic-acid-809x1024.jpg 809w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-alpha-lipoic-acid-237x300.jpg 237w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-alpha-lipoic-acid-768x972.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-alpha-lipoic-acid-1213x1536.jpg 1213w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-alpha-lipoic-acid-9x12.jpg 9w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-alpha-lipoic-acid.jpg 1264w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 809px) 100vw, 809px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Alpha Lipoic Acid</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A strong antioxidant that helps to regenerate other antioxidants such as vitamins C and E and supports nerve health and metabolism.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"808\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-immune-plus-808x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Hands forming a heart on the stomach\" class=\"wp-image-344\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-immune-plus-808x1024.jpg 808w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-immune-plus-237x300.jpg 237w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-immune-plus-768x973.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-immune-plus-1212x1536.jpg 1212w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-immune-plus-9x12.jpg 9w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-immune-plus.jpg 1263w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 808px) 100vw, 808px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Immune Plus</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Supports immune function, energy metabolism and antioxidant capacity.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-collagen-booster-685x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Smiling woman holding a green smoothie\" class=\"wp-image-345\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-collagen-booster-685x1024.jpg 685w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-collagen-booster-201x300.jpg 201w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-collagen-booster-768x1148.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-collagen-booster-1027x1536.jpg 1027w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-collagen-booster-8x12.jpg 8w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-iv-collagen-booster.jpg 1070w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Anti-ageing Collagen Booster</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Amino acids, vitamins and minerals that support collagen production, skin health and overall vitality.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Glutathione</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A powerful antioxidant that supports the body&#8217;s natural detoxification and the immune system and helps protect cells from oxidative stress.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How MedLuxLife supports you</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Free consultation</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Share your wishes and, if available, recent X-rays or photos. We answer your questions and explain the options.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal treatment plan</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our partner specialists prepare a treatment plan and an estimated timeline tailored to you.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Travel &amp; treatment</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We coordinate your appointments, hotel and airport transfers, so you can focus on your treatment.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Aftercare</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-parag